From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:10:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rtl837x: release internal PHY initialization

Signal host initialization readiness before registering the internal PHY bus, allowing the internal PHY boot state to progress after a switch core reset. Wait for the hardware initialization interval used in the RTL8372N reference flow. Keep PHY configuration and auto negotiation under the kernel PHY driver.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/src/rtl8372n.c
+++ b/src/rtl8372n.c
@@ -2354,6 +2354,13 @@ static int rtl8372n_setup(struct dsa_swi
 			return ret;
 	}
 
+	if (!priv->preserve_boot_config) {
+		ret = regmap_set_bits(priv->map, 0x6040, BIT(0));
+		if (ret)
+			return ret;
+		msleep(100);
+	}
+
 	ret = rtl8372n_setup_mdio(priv);
 	if (ret) {
 		dev_err(priv->dev, "rtl8372n_setup_mdio Fail, error:%d\n", ret);
